# 99acres Clone — Workspace AI Rules
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file is read by Antigravity IDE at session start.
# Canonical workspace rules live in .agents/AGENTS.md (auto-loaded).
# This file serves as a human-readable mirror and reference.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## 1. UI Styling Convention

Visual system: "Stamp Paper & Registry" (see DESIGN.md). Use component classes
from apps/web/src/app/globals.css instead of long inline Tailwind strings:

| Token            | Use when                                              |
|------------------|-------------------------------------------------------|
| `.sheet`         | Any document surface (cards, panels, menus)           |
| `.btn-seal`      | Primary action (registry violet), one per view        |
| `.btn-ink`       | Secondary action (ink outline)                        |
| `.btn-quiet`     | Tertiary / text action                                |
| `.chip`          | Toggle choices; state via aria-pressed / aria-checked |
| `.input-line`    | Text typed on a ruled line                            |
| `.input-box`     | Boxed inputs, selects, textareas                      |
| `.field-label`   | Uppercase field label (never above a heading)         |
| `.container-app` | Max-width content wrapper                             |

Colours: `paper`, `sheet`, `ink(-soft/-faint)`, `stamp(-light/-dark)`, `seal(-dark/-wash)`,
`rule`, `danger` (Tailwind names backed by CSS variables).

## 2. Scope Discipline

- Only read/edit files **explicitly specified** in the active prompt.
- Do NOT perform full workspace scans (`list_dir`, `grep_search` across entire repo)
  unless the user explicitly asks for a workspace-wide search or refactor.
- When fixing a bug, read only the file containing the error and its direct imports.

## 3. Cross-Session Memory

- Read `MEMORY.md` at the start of every session to restore active context.
- After completing a major milestone (feature, bug-fix batch, refactor),
  update `MEMORY.md` with current status, resolved errors, and next steps.

## 4. TypeScript & Next.js Rules

- **No `any` types** — use `unknown` + type narrowing, or define explicit interfaces.
- **Server Components by default** — only add `"use client"` when hooks/events are needed.
- **Dynamic SEO metadata** — every listing/search page must export a `generateMetadata` function.
- **Imports** — use extensionless paths in `apps/web` (webpack bundler mode).
  Use `.js` extensions only in `apps/api-server` (Node ESM mode).
- **No `fastify.authenticate` in route files** — always use the standalone `authGuard`
  middleware from `apps/api-server/src/middleware/authGuard.ts`.

