## 6. Key File Locations

- Global CSS tokens:   `apps/web/src/app/globals.css`
- Tailwind config:     `apps/web/tailwind.config.ts`
- Design system:       `DESIGN.md` + `.impeccable/design.json`
- Product context:     `PRODUCT.md`
- Root layout:         `apps/web/src/app/layout.tsx`
- Homepage:            `apps/web/src/app/(main)/page.tsx`
- API auth guard:      `apps/api-server/src/middleware/authGuard.ts`
- Auth plugin:         `apps/api-server/src/plugins/auth.ts`
- DB schema:           `packages/db/src/schema/index.ts`
- UI package index:    `packages/ui/src/index.ts` (extensionless exports only)
